{"ref":"BDB, שָׂבַר²","hw":"שָׂבַר²","html":"† II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂבַר</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Pi.</strong>  <strong> wait, hope (</strong>Aramaism; cf. Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">סְבַר</span> <em>think</em>, Pa. <em>hope;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ܣܒܰܪ</span> <em>believe, hope</em>, Pa. <em>think</em>, Aph. <em>hope</em><strong>)</strong>;—Pf. 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂבַּרְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:166\" href=\"/Psalms.119.166\">ψ 119:166</a>, 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂבְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:1\" href=\"/Esther.9.1\">Est 9:1</a>; Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְשַׂבְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.18\">Is 38:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְשַׂבֵּ֑רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:15\" href=\"/Psalms.145.15\">ψ 145:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְשַׂבֵּר֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:27\" href=\"/Psalms.104.27\">ψ 104:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:2\" href=\"/Psalms.104.2\">2</a> fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּשַׂבֵּרְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:13\" href=\"/Ruth.1.13\">Ru 1:13</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>wait</em> + <span dir=\"rtl\">לָהֵן</span> <em>therefor</em> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:13\" href=\"/Ruth.1.13\">Ru 1:13</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>hope</em> for, ל rei <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:166\" href=\"/Psalms.119.166\">ψ 119:166</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> rei <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.18\">Is 38:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:27\" href=\"/Psalms.104.27\">ψ 104:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:15\" href=\"/Psalms.145.15\">145:15</a>; ל inf. <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:1\" href=\"/Esther.9.1\">Est 9:1</a> <em>hope to rule</em>.","next":"BDB, שֵׂ֫בֶר","prev":"BDB, שָׂבַר"}